      "v": 5,
      "zh": "使者回来见王，王问他们说：「你们为甚么回来呢？」",
      "en": "When the messengers returned to the king,[NOTE:1] he asked them, “Why have you returned?”",
      "notes": [
        "Heb “to him.”sn The narrative is elliptical and telescoped here. The account of Elijah encountering the messengers and delivering the Lord’s message is omitted; we only hear of it as the messengers report what happened to the king."
