      "zh": "回答说：「他身穿毛衣，腰束皮带。」王说：「这必是提斯比人以利亚。」",
      "en": "They replied,[NOTE:1] “He was a hairy[NOTE:2] man and had a leather belt[NOTE:3] tied around his waist.” The king[NOTE:4] said, “He is Elijah the Tishbite.”",
