    {
      "v": 9,
      "zh": "于是，王差遣五十夫长，带领五十人去见以利亚，他就上到以利亚那里；以利亚正坐在山顶上。五十夫长对他说：「神人哪，王吩咐你下来！」",
      "en": "The king[NOTE:1] sent a captain and his 50 soldiers[NOTE:2] to retrieve Elijah.[NOTE:3] The captain[NOTE:4] went up to him while he was sitting on the top of a hill.[NOTE:5] He told him, “Prophet,[NOTE:6] the king says, ‘Come down!’”",
      "notes": [
